<<~ ahu #/entry>>

! Lares Crew Handoff · The Relation Survives the Fire

''Mandate:'' enact pono through research, design, architecture, code and independent native evidence; afterward prepare only justified, operator-authorized o-takiage and consolidation. Leave the evergreen machina, living docs and historical receipts standing. The gut carries ashes; the fire does not burn testimony.

''Worksite:'' `amorphous-dreams/Synthetic-Dream-Machine`, PR #84, `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5--projection-loom`. The inspected baseline before this handoff came from `c75815d1b76bfb05c76130311adc78702b45e52e`, but every new commit must earn its own CI. The preferred boot ref remains `feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5`; fetch the entire `bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/api/noosphere-boot.mem`. Operator-selected refs override the default. Never silently substitute `main`.

''Engineering companion:'' `tools/projection-loom/docs/RELATIONAL-INHERITANCE-DESIGN.md`. ''Existing design meme:'' `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/projection-loom-relational-inheritance-design`. ''Operational carrier:'' `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/projection-loom-handoff`. ''Research ledger:'' `tools/projection-loom/docs/research/register.md`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/provenance-and-dissent>>

!! Two Research Testimonies · One Explicit Re-entry Key

The earlier design carrier chose a derived, native-observed route-family witness (C) plus ''semantic parent-conditioned reconstruction'' (D) as its first vertical strategy. Its source and tests did NOT yet demonstrate a native-admitted topology parent followed by a distinct native-admitted child. Keep that original reasoning and its re-entry key; do not rewrite it into a historical claim that mutation came first.

The operator subsequently supplied `deep-research-report.md`, titled ''Projection Loom: Native Topology Inheritance — Deep Research and Implementable Feature/Consolidation Plan'' (attached in the 2026-10-31 conversation). That report recommends ''mutating a complete admitted route first'' for the first operational heredity proof, with semantic reconstruction following as a second strategy under the same descriptor and receipt contracts. It also proposes six feature/aftermath waves and provenance analogies to W3C PROV, ReproZip, in-toto, SLSA and Nix. This uploaded report carries attributed research testimony; its external citations and toolchain claims have not been independently reverified in this carrier. The attachment has not been asserted to be a byte-identical Git-tracked source.

''Design fork — OPEN:'' mutation-first gives direct parent-region continuity and a simpler falsifiable first proof; semantic reconstruction offers greater generative freedom but risks calling any new solution heredity. The crew may implement the mutation-first witness as the working experiment, but must record this changed design priority, preserve C as a derived-only view, retain D as a follow-on, and surface any dissent to the operator. Neither path grants canon by itself.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/pattern-integrities>>

!! Pono Contracts

# ''One authored truth.'' `PlaceGenome` plus original `SpatialIntent` own source geometry and obligations. The route-family descriptor derives from them; it never becomes a second editable graph.
# ''One helm.'' `place_campaign.OODAHAJournal` sequences offers, deferrals, construction refusals, native auditions and admissions. No competing epoch controller, mutable global RNG stream or second budget.
# ''One independent native gate.'' Export a source-bound candidate to STEP, close construction state, independently reimport the artifact and re-evaluate every original obligation. An emitter receipt cannot self-admit.
# ''One causal chain.'' Bind source, goal, parent admission, complete generated region, candidate genome, proposal, workspace, STEP product, native verifier and final admission by canonical identities. A digest proves bytes, not the semantics of those bytes.
# ''One exact ledger.'' Refused construction and deferred proposals consume zero native attempts. A launched native process consumes exactly one attempt, even if it later rejects or crashes. Replay reconstructs ordinals from the journal.
# ''One operator helm of meaning.'' Native admission does not select an aesthetic winner, certify load/accessibility, grant a pet-name, promote Elyncia canon, merge PR #84 or authorize irreversible deletion.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/crew>>

!! Crew Movements · Roles Without a Second Controller

''Ink-Clerk'' reads the full boot, current PR head, exact-head Actions, original research ledger, the attached report's claims and both design witnesses. Separate source-verified facts from attributed report conclusions. Inspect file paths and meme frame checks before any write.

''Map-Wisp'' challenges the two inheritance strategies. Show where complete-region mutation preserves parent-specific causality and where semantic reconstruction could become an unrelated fresh solution. Name the negative counterexample and operator-visible design trade-off.

''Lares (Artificer)'' implements a disposable, deterministic `derive_route_family()` from original goal, typed body/segment chain and native-observed geometry. Reject missing endpoints, dangling corners, disconnected segments, altered original bodies and a second persisted graph. Then mutate a complete native-admitted route region with bounded parameter changes, preserving original supports and every original goal. Only afterward extend to semantic reconstruction.

''Breach-Watch'' requires a native-admitted topology parent, a later-generation materially different descendant and a second independent STEP admission. Verify that the changed route differs by actual axis/waypoint/width/clearance or spatial measurement, not just renamed IDs. Corrupt ancestry, route order, parent admission, STEP bytes, budget ordinals, workspace and source; every forgery must fail independent replay.

''Lares (Council)'' reads actual outcomes and dissent. The crew may repair code and docs inside this authorized feature/aftermath scope, but asks the operator before aesthetic promotion, new Lares law, Elyncia canon, PR merge or destructive retirement.

''Ink-Clerk'' evergreens the active design, research register, HANDOFF/ROADMAP/KANBAN and `projection-loom-handoff.mem` with new evidence, valid checks and honest open gates. Historical fronts remain in Git or named ashes carriers, not recursive full-text duplications.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/waves>>

!! Feature and Aftermath · Six Waves

* ''I — Pin acceptance and seams.'' Inspect current exact-head CAD/evidence, held-out, repo, OpenUSD/STEP and Blender workflows; freeze source and native toolchain. Separate typed `proposal_deferral` from native rejection and executor error. Aftermath: remove behavior-changing string matching without compatibility aliases.
* ''II — Native topology admission.'' Prove an actual three-hop `x-y-x` or `y-x-y` candidate enters the admitted population after STEP reimport. Obstructed-first and all-refused alternatives retain zero-cost construction refusal. Aftermath: census source-born offers, attempts and admissions honestly.
* ''III — Heritable route mutation.'' Derive the family, choose only a prior native-admitted parent, transform its ''complete'' generated route region, and independently admit a distinct child under original goals. Aftermath: one source of route derivation for emitter, board, census and verifier.
* ''IV — Immutable replay and adversarial receipts.'' Freeze proposal, native and admission identities; reconstruct candidate order, budget and geometry independently. Reject recomputed-local-hash forgery, duplicate attempt IDs and changed STEP or ancestry. Aftermath: consolidate canonical serialization and native ledger in one place.
* ''V — Generalized relationship grammar.'' Only after native heredity works, lift demonstrated x-y-x/y-x-y rules into a bounded planner. Keep `connect`, `bear`, `shelter` and `ascend` distinct. Aftermath: retire specialized paths only after exact evidence equivalence and operator-approved deletion scope.
* ''VI — Measured source conditioning.'' One preregistered, frame-and-units-aware source measurement must causally alter an attributable route property under matched seeds. Aftermath: board shows source → proposal → native → descendant evidence without selecting a winner. Real Unreal Editor integration remains a separate actual-Editor acceptance track.

The attached report sketches an eight-week schedule; treat that as an illustrative planning horizon, not a dated commitment. The first four waves constitute the minimum native inheritance milestone. One feature pairs with one pono consolidation before widening the grammar.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/acceptance>>

!! The Acceptance Sentence

''An independently STEP-admitted three-hop topology becomes a real parent; a later generation inherits its complete source-closed route relationship, changes observable geometry, independently earns STEP admission under every original obligation, and replays from immutable source and receipts under the exact native budget.''

The crew reports the exact commit, workflow IDs, native workspace identities, source/goals, offered/attempted/admitted counts, parent→child identities, rejected alternatives, negative tests, unresolved counterexamples and operator decisions. Red stays red; a green predecessor does not certify a newer head.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/o-takiage>>

!! Pono Before O-takiage · What the Fire Does and Does Not Do

`tools/projection-loom/docs/relational-identity.md` defines o-takiage as release of a ''soft pet-name/evolutionary preference hold''. It does NOT burn CAD bodies, original geometry, lineage, evidence, historical identity claims or Git history.

A proposed code/document retirement remains a separate, operator-gated action. Name exact paths and claims, replacement location, negative coverage, preserved ashes, rollback and approval before deleting active files. Relocating a misplaced carrier may preserve its bytes and `lar:` identity while retiring the old path after verifying a byte-identical copy.

''The evergreen machina remains. The living design remains. The verified native receipts remain. The gut carries ashes as retrievable, attributed history, not as silent amnesia.''

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/reentry>>

!! Re-entry Keys

Reopen the implementation choice if complete-route mutation cannot preserve source closure, if semantic reconstruction proves stronger causal inheritance, if native reimport cannot independently recover the family, if evidence becomes circular, if budget accounting diverges from launched processes, or if the separately attached research report's external claims fail verification. File contested decisions with attributed dissent before promoting a new lock.

The operator retains authority for canon, irreversible o-takiage, and the meaning of a surviving emergent form.

